{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345470/extras/4b8508527f476951f9c090a4dbe11e5c.avif?t=1758625045\" width=550 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf92 Grab your backpack and get ready for a cozy Hidden Object Journey across Europe!</strong>  <br>Take a relaxing journey through <strong>30 stunning locations</strong>, from the \ud83d\uddfc <i>Eiffel Tower in Paris</i> to the \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f <i>Colosseum in Rome</i>. Search and find hundreds of hidden items, collect \u2709\ufe0f postcards and \ud83d\udc8e diamonds, and enjoy the beauty of Europe in this <strong>cozy Hidden Object game</strong> designed to help you unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its peaceful atmosphere, \ud83c\udfa8 colorful artwork, and \ud83c\udfb6 calming music, this game offers a truly <strong>cozy puzzle experience</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a Hidden Object fan, a travel lover, or simply looking for a casual way to relax, <i>Amazing Trip to Europe</i> is the perfect cozy escape after a long day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 Explore <strong>30 beautiful European locations</strong> filled with hidden objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2709\ufe0f Collect <strong>postcards</strong> and \ud83d\udc8e <strong>diamonds</strong> as cozy rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Relaxing atmospheres and \ud83c\udfb6 calming background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf Multiple game modes for added variety and cozy challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Hours of fun for <strong>Hidden Object fans of all ages</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Bonus features: <strong>Pet Shop</strong> and <strong>Postcard Collection</strong>.